WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Which moved first: the hand or the table? Faraday asked an instrument, not an impression.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Small pressure came first; the table followed. Feeling certain didn't settle the cause.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Twelve minutes can be a useful appointment. That doesn't prove it replaces an hour of meditation.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Zen12 advertises guided, music, white noise and nature sessions. We have not verified its promised effects.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Try a free session first. Read the evidence, then decide what the routine is worth to you.
